    "theorem": "TheriaultIntersectionsAudit.theriault_intersections_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem theriault_intersections_certificate : (∀ M : ℕ, Fintype.card (PairedPoint M) = 2 * M ∧ Function.Involutive (@negatePoint M) ∧ (∀ a : PairedPoint M, negatePoint a ≠ a) ∧ (∀ a b : PairedPoint M, a.1 = b.1 ↔ b = a ∨ b = negatePoint a)) ∧ (∀ (M s : ℕ) [NeZero M] (w : PairedWord M s), uniformPMF (PairedWord M s) w = ∏ i : Fin s, uniformPMF (PairedPoint M) (w i)) ∧ (∀ (M s : ℕ) [NeZero M], 0 < s → (∀ k : ℕ, 0 ≤ intersectionProbability M s k) ∧ (∑ k ∈ range s, intersectionProbability M s k) = 1 ∧ sourceMean M s = pairedMean M s ∧ sourceMean M s = (s : ℝ) - M + M * (1 - (M : ℝ)⁻¹) ^ s) ∧ (∀ (M s : ℕ) [NeZero M], pairedMean M (s + 1) = (1 - (M : ℝ)⁻¹) * pairedMean M s + (s : ℝ) / M) ∧ (∀ (M : ℕ) [NeZero M], 4 ≤ M → 3 ≤ (3 : ℕ) ∧ 3 < (2 * M) / 2 ∧ sourceMean M 3 = 3 / (M : ℝ) - 1 / (M : ℝ) ^ 2 ∧ sourceMean M 3 < 2 * (3 : ℝ) ^ 2 / (3 * (2 * M))) ∧ (¬∀ (M s : ℕ) [NeZero M], 3 ≤ s → s < (2 * M) / 2 → 2 * (s : ℝ) ^ 2 / (3 * (2 * M)) ≤ sourceMean M s) ∧ (Fintype.card (PairedPoint 4) = 8 ∧ Fintype.card (PairedWord 4 3) = 512 ∧ sourceMean 4 3 = 11 / 16 ∧ 2 * (3 : ℝ) ^ 2 / (3 * 8) = 3 / 4 ∧ sourceMean 4 3 < 3 / 4) ∧ (∀ (M s : ℕ) [NeZero M], 3 ≤ s → s < (2 * M) / 2 → 4 * (s : ℝ) ^ 2 / (9 * (2 * M)) ≤ sourceMean M s ∧ sourceMean M s ≤ (s : ℝ) ^ 2 / (2 * M))",
    "decl_sha256": "382c82b534b06bdbfdc28545d65acb0a2c1ea9e303eb73ca3f02ec130f2e9175",
    "scope": "Original Theriault2003 Theorem1 literal lower bound counterexample and proved repair in its actual finite iid paired-point model. Actual points FinM×Bool have cardinalityn=2M, actual fixedpointfree involution Booleanflip and proven sameorbit iff equalityornegative. Actual uniformPMF on all finite pointwords has proven productmasses of independentuniformpointdraws. Actual repeatcount=s−distinctorbitcount, actual Qeventprobabilities/nonnegativity/normalization and actual sourceE=sum_k kQ are derived from that PMF. Prove actualmean E=s−M+M(1−1/M)^s and source recurrence. For every M≥4 and s=3 all literal3≤s<n/2 guards hold but actualE=3/M−1/M²<3/M=2s²/(3n), directly negating the qualified source universal lower bound. Explicitn8actual512samples gives E11/16<3/4. Prove repaired4s²/(9n)≤E≤s²/n throughout original3≤s<n/2 window, from stronger actualrecurrence bounds. No probabilityrecurrence/expectedvalue conclusion is a premise. Exact primary printed85–86/PDF11–12 Theorem1/lastchain visually inspected after full18page read. Refutes that finite lower constant only; does not refute Theorem3singlelargeprime complexity exponent or claim wholeJacobian/Picard/randomwalk/smoothness/linearalgebra algorithm verification. Knownoccupancymethod credited/no noveltyclaim. Original44unreadsnapshot/canonicalcorpusstatus unchanged; additiveprimaryread/formalcoverage only. Priorproof/artifact/claim bytes unchanged. Standardfoundations/defaults/no holes/customaxioms/nativeproofeval/limits/flags/waivers/newcryptoexperiment/spend/upload. Nativewrittenheader parsing/hash procedural, not kernel parser/hash/physicalhostrefinement.",
